# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# prefs: factory
# statvfs: slow 150
# A mount that answers slowly costs the loop nothing.
#
# Every few hundred milliseconds the desk asks each mount how much room
# it has, and a mount gone away on the network answers never.  Here every
# statvfs takes a hundred and fifty milliseconds -- with thirty mounts,
# seconds per scan -- and the loop is asked how long its turns got.
wait 200
expect-under turns 100
note and the mounts are still known
expect-read mounts Boot
quit
